'''Chroma Tides''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
It has a long, slightly curved blade with three small chromatic tidal waves flowing along the side, hence the name. The guard is made up of a triangular color alternating crystal with more tidal waves eroding out from it, which forms the quillons. The handle has four engraved grips, and a crystal pommel attached to the bottom of it.

==Trivia==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Tides]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/241017568/Mythic-Sword-of-the-Tides Mythic Sword of the Tides].
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duped]].

